  {
    "id": 1023001010010,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "わ～♡\r\n今日はよろしくお願いします～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はい、よろしくお願いします\r\nそれでは、まず自己紹介を……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010020,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "は～い♡\r\n市川雛菜、高校１年生です～～～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "023",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう\r\nアイドルを志望した理由を聞かせてくれるかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～とね～\r\n透先輩がアイドルやるって聞いて～……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "すっごくいいな～、雛菜もやりたいな～\r\nって思って来ました♡",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\n次に特技を聞かせてください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "特技～……？\r\nん～なんでもそれなりにできる～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんでもそれなりに……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "運動とか勉強とか、割とできる！\r\nだからアイドルやるのも楽しみ～～～♡",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nアイドルはどんなイメージかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～、アイドルは～、\r\n楽しくてしあわせ～♡　ってイメージ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、そういうイメージが\r\n強いかもしれないな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、アイドルは楽しいことばかりじゃない\r\n大変なこともたくさんあるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "え～、大変なのはやだ～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010081,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あっ！　雛菜は楽しい担当がいい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010081"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "楽しい担当……か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "どんなことでも楽しく、\r\nしあわせ～にやるのがいちばんでしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、アイドルとして\r\nファンにはいつも笑顔を見せてもらいたいよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ね～？\r\n雛菜、それ得意かも～～～♡",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "よく～、『雛菜はしあわせそうでいいね～』\r\nって言われるもん～～～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか\r\n今もすごく楽しそうだし、いい笑顔だもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～♡\r\nありがとうございます～～～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜はどんな時でもね\r\n楽し～く、しあわせ～に過ごすの",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……みんなもそうしたらいいのにね？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうできたら\r\n一番いいんだろうけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "きっとそうできない人もいる\r\n……いや、そうできない人の方が多いんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからそういう人を笑顔にするのが\r\nアイドルの仕事なんじゃないかって思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そっか～……\r\nじゃあ雛菜、アイドルに向いてるね？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だって雛菜のしあわせ～なとこ見てたら\r\nみんなもしあわせ～って気持ちになるでしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あはは……そうだな\r\nその通りかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……よし、ありがとう\r\n以上で面接は終了だ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "え～～～、雛菜もっと\r\nお話したかった～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫\r\nこれから話す機会はたくさんあるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "２８３プロのアイドルとして\r\n……よろしく、雛菜",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "やは～♡　ほんと～？\r\nうれしい～～～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、期待してるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雛菜のこと頑張って\r\nプロデュースしていくからさ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "うん！\r\nじゃあ頑張ってプロデュースされる～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "よろしくね～～♡\r\n雛菜、プロデューサーのことすきかも～～～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300002/1023001010200"
  },
